{
  "_comment": [
    "The shared corpus for `sync_engine_equivalence` (P4.D210): the document-store",
    "sync run end to end against a real store and a real directory, on both sides,",
    "from the same script.",
    "",
    "Read by BOTH drivers — `harness/oracle/cases/sync-engine.test.ts` (v4's real",
    "`syncMountPoint` over its real repositories) and",
    "`crates/quilltap-harness/tests/sync_engine_equivalence.rs` (v5's) — so the two",
    "cannot drift apart by transcription. It covers the ground of v4's own",
    "`engine.integration.test.ts` (eight describe groups, ~40 cases) plus the",
    "shapes that file leaves implicit.",
    "",
    "EVERY clock is explicit. A seed or a disk write with no `lastModified` would",
    "take `now` on each side independently, and the sync propagates clocks between",
    "the sides, so the comparand would be noise. The store writers accept explicit",
    "per-location timestamps since v4 `23da0b322` seam 4, which is exactly what",
    "makes this corpus deterministic.",
    "",
    "`bytes` fields are base64. `PNG` is v4's own fixture payload — bytes that",
    "LOOK like a PNG header and are not a decodable image, which is why v4's",
    "'byte for byte, no WebP transcode' case passes there; see",
    "`apply_store.rs`'s header for the measurement.",
    "",
    "A text document's description has no write chokepoint on either side (`linkDocumentContent` takes none, and `updateDescription` is the BLOB repository's), so the 'a text document's caption is reported as unsynced' rule is proven at tier 1 in `sync_planner_equivalence` instead of here rather than inventing one."
  ],
  "constants": {
    "T0": "2026-09-01T10:00:00.000Z",
    "T1": "2026-09-10T10:00:00.000Z",
    "T2": "2026-09-20T10:00:00.000Z",
    "BIRTH": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
    "PNG_BASE64": "iVBORw0KGgogYW5kIHRoZW4gc29tZSBieXRlcyB0aGF0IGFyZSBub3QgcmVhbGx5IGEgUE5H",
    "PNG_EDITED_BASE64": "iVBORw0KGgogYW5kIHRoZW4gc29tZSBESUZGRVJFTlQgYnl0ZXMgdGhhdCBhcmUgbm90IHJlYWxseSBhIFBORw==",
    "INVALID_UTF8_BASE64": "IyBoZWFkaW5nCv/+IG5vdCB1dGYtOAo="
  },
